    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-assertion-intro",
        "moduleId": "assertion-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "断言的定义",
        "markdown": "断言（ASSERTION）是SQL中一种更一般的完整性约束。断言可以涉及多个表，用来表达跨越多个表的复杂约束条件。与CHECK约束只能在单个表中定义不同，断言可以在数据库级别定义全局约束。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000339"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库完整性",
                "断言"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6289,
              "lineEnd": 6292,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2c1080696c953981fb2cfa62b3090ebda04021e924bd98ac1face8f522944957"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000340"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库完整性",
                "创建断言的语句格式"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6293,
              "lineEnd": 6331,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a31ba68e9f5238c811d8299dead3d288c98ef59f4debd186964c2c3e759d936a"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-assertion-example",
        "moduleId": "assertion-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "断言创建示例",
        "markdown": "例如，限制数据库中每个系的学生人数不超过1000：\n\n```sql\nCREATE ASSERTION ASSE_Scount\nCHECK (1000 >= ALL\n       (SELECT COUNT(*)\n        FROM Student\n        GROUP BY Sdept));\n```\n\n删除断言：\n\n```sql\nDROP ASSERTION ASSE_Scount;\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-assertion-intro"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-assertion-limit",
        "moduleId": "assertion-boundary",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "断言、CHECK与触发器的对比",
        "markdown": "| 特性 | CHECK | 断言 | 触发器 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 作用范围 | 单表 | 多表/全局 | 单表或多表 |\n| 检查时机 | INSERT/UPDATE | 任何影响数据的操作 | 指定事件触发 |\n| 表达能力 | 简单条件 | 复杂条件（含聚合、子查询） | 任意逻辑（可含流程控制） |\n| 违约处理 | 拒绝操作 | 拒绝操作 | 可自定义（报错、修正、记录日志） |\n| 标准支持 | 广泛支持 | 部分系统不支持或实现有限 | 广泛支持 |\n\n断言的优势在于声明式表达跨表全局约束，但因其检查开销大且标准支持不一致，实际生产中复杂约束往往用触发器实现。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-assertion-intro"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "exercise-assertion-check",
        "moduleId": "check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "断言概念检查",
        "markdown": "判断以下说法是否正确：\n\n1. 断言可以引用多个表的数据，而CHECK约束通常只能引用当前表。\n2. 断言在创建后不会自动检查已有数据是否满足条件。\n3. 所有主流数据库管理系统都完整支持CREATE ASSERTION语句。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-assertion-intro",
            "model-assertion-limit"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-assertion-delete",
        "moduleId": "assertion-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "删除断言",
        "markdown": "删除断言使用DROP ASSERTION语句：\n\n```sql\nDROP ASSERTION <断言名>;\n```",
